From e7958c3122783fa2ff11ddc5e51ed41b11e35891 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Werner Stein <werner.stein@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:51:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): allow an explicit VPN listen address

Keep the JSON API on its private unix socket and preserve web sign-in. Refuse wildcard, named and non-unicast addresses and keep direct VPN access subject to the existing remote account checks.

Refs: #539
Co-Authored-By: Codex gpt-6.1-sol <noreply@openai.com>
